The Lord of Blades is a warforged warlord of unknown identity who claims dominion over [[The Mournland]], leading a militant faction that seeks to establish a sovereign warforged nation free from organic rule.

His true name and original designation are unknown — some believe he is among the first warforged ever built by [[House Cannith]], while others claim the Mourning itself transformed a lesser construct into something more powerful. He wears ornate bladed plate armor and commands total loyalty from his forces.

The Lord of Blades rejects the Treaty of Thronehold's treatment of warforged as "freed property." He sees the Mournland as rightfully warforged territory and actively hunts organic trespassers — especially [[House Cannith]] agents.

!! Goals
* Establish an independent warforged nation in the Mournland
* Recover and control all [[House Cannith]] creation forges within former [[Cyre]]
* Destroy or subvert House Cannith's remaining influence over warforged
* Expand warforged numbers; convert or eliminate "organic oppressors"

!! Connections
* [[The Mournland]] (claimed domain)
